    sourceFull: "Whole score (81 measures), same Mutopia import as the opening above (EinFesteBurg.ly, Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0). The earlier 'broken at m31' block was the left hand's two-voice passage: its upper voice ends at bar 30 and the lower runs to bar 40, which made the converter merge bars 31-32. Padding the upper voice with invisible rests (bars 31-40) fixed it without changing any note; ly_abc_compare.py then found 0 differing bars across both staves. The chorale's repeat (bars 41-55) was re-placed by repair_abc.py, and its laissez-vibrer/repeat ties (bars 55-56) are dropped, as ABC cannot express them."

